Camden Levine is a mid-level manager of the [[Org/Pale Lantern Society/index|Pale Lantern Society]] and the head of a hospital in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]]. He rose from administrative assistant to that post, promoted three times in a hurry around the time [[Org/Pyrelight/index|Pyrelight]] rose. Not long before, he moved to a cheaper flat nearer [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Teller's Run/index|Teller's Run]].

He is not a member of Pyrelight. [[Org/Belvedere/index|Belvedere]] suspects a connection between him and the gang and has not confirmed it. He and [[People/Elara Vance|Elara Vance]] attended the opera at the same times across several weeks.

The [[Org/Embercall Industries/index|Embercall]]'s research logs name C. Levine as the lead of Project Synthesis. He helped graft a newly synthesized harmony onto the [[Phenomena/Harmony/Voidsong|Voidsong]] without the two tearing each other apart, which the company counted a success.
